  "purpose": "Cumulative pinned wrapper overlay: preserve the private fail-closed buffered OS entropy and authenticated precomputed commitment APIs byte-for-byte; import the regenerated unified constraint layout and quotient for the outer-execution CSR delegation guard; bind native wrapper and compression verification to their circuit-owned proof configuration. The circuit change requires fresh setup, verification-key, binary commitment, and release qualification; this source manifest does not attest generated setup artifacts, a deployed verifier, or a proof."
